  "findings": [
    "The105 selected individual fits improve all105 whole-card scores, with192 unchanged faces and no outside-rules or alpha/etching changes. Rules/flavor nonfoil mean65.247 to74.647/100.",
    "The shallow text-length/inline-token rule improves25 and regresses19 full cards:80.525 to80.696/100. Its small mean gain does not explain the individual font-size variation.",
    "Final M21 measuring/painting is fractional, but the preserved legacy line-count budget may use rounded advances. Unrefitted fully fractional or consistent budgets reduce the whole-cohort text objective. This mixed path remains explicit; do not equate fractional font sizes with an entirely fractional fit policy.",
    "Printing punctuation uses curved marks where tested. Global punctuation and budget changes are not promoted solely because their shapes are plausible; full-census residuals stay explicit.",
    "Individual fits are in-sample finite-printing diagnostics, not evidence of a rule that generalizes to other cards, printings, Oracle wording or custom text. No per-card runtime overrides shipped.",
    "Aven Gagglemaster retains the known frozen frame-context eligibility defect. Common-eligible component means still improve80.523 to83.284/100 for the individual proposal."
